WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.310
"I can't wait to try rock climbing!" Mason said.

2
00:00:08.311 --> 00:00:11.509
"It's going to be so much fun!"

3
00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:17.438
Olivia bit her lip. "Um, yeah. I can't wait either."

4
00:00:17.439 --> 00:00:22.263
Mason laughed. "You're not going to like rock climbing.

5
00:00:22.264 --> 00:00:25.341
You're afraid of heights, Olivia!"

6
00:00:25.342 --> 00:00:30.349
"I am not!" Olivia folded her arms across her chest.

7
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:36.322
She was terrified, but of course, she didn't want her brother to know that.

8
00:00:36.323 --> 00:00:41.738
"We're here," Mom said as she pulled into the parking lot.

9
00:00:41.739 --> 00:00:44.743
"You two have fun."

10
00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:48.923
Olivia and Mason went inside.

11
00:00:48.924 --> 00:00:53.534
An instructor asked the siblings for their shoe sizes.

12
00:00:53.535 --> 00:00:57.660
She grabbed a pair of rock-climbing shoes for each of them.

13
00:00:57.661 --> 00:01:04.801
After that she helped them put on harnesses and took them into the gym.

14
00:01:04.802 --> 00:01:11.065
Olivia gasped. The walls were even taller than she'd expected.

15
00:01:11.066 --> 00:01:15.661
They were dotted with colorful objects that looked like rocks.

16
00:01:15.662 --> 00:01:18.550
"What are those?" she asked.

17
00:01:18.551 --> 00:01:23.728
"You use them to climb up the walls," the instructor said.

18
00:01:23.729 --> 00:01:26.389
"Different colors mark different routes.

19
00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:29.680
Some routes are more difficult than others."

20
00:01:29.681 --> 00:01:32.924
"What do we do first?" Mason blurted out.

21
00:01:32.925 --> 00:01:35.728
"I'm ready to start!"

22
00:01:35.729 --> 00:01:45.388
The instructor gave a short demonstration on how to climb.

23
00:01:45.389 --> 00:01:51.030
"All of our walls have devices that control the rope as you climb," she said.

24
00:01:51.031 --> 00:01:54.931
"Just hook the rope onto your harness and climb.

25
00:01:54.932 --> 00:02:00.118
When you lean back, the device will lower you slowly."

26
00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:08.843
"Awesome!" Mason ran to a wall, hooked a rope onto his harness, and started to climb.

27
00:02:08.844 --> 00:02:11.156
He looked down at his sister.

28
00:02:11.157 --> 00:02:14.270
"I'm going to beat you to the top!"

29
00:02:14.271 --> 00:02:19.265
"Stop bragging!" Olivia said as she stepped up to the wall.

30
00:02:19.266 --> 00:02:22.641
She clipped the rope onto her harness.

31
00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:27.642
Carefully she placed her foot on a rock and got onto the wall.

32
00:02:27.643 --> 00:02:35.050
When she felt ready, she climbed a bit higher.

33
00:02:35.051 --> 00:02:41.539
She looked up at her brother, who was already halfway up the wall.

34
00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:46.353
"I can do this," she told herself. "I'm not scared."

35
00:02:46.354 --> 00:02:52.066
Each time Olivia got a little higher, she took a deep breath.

36
00:02:52.067 --> 00:02:58.279
Then, when she felt comfortable, she climbed some more.

37
00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:03.126
She felt all of her muscles straining, but she enjoyed the feeling.

38
00:03:03.127 --> 00:03:08.336
In fact, she was starting to feel a lot less scared.

39
00:03:08.337 --> 00:03:12.333
Soon she heard a bell ring from above.

40
00:03:12.334 --> 00:03:17.063
"I'm at the top! I won!" Mason yelled.

41
00:03:17.064 --> 00:03:21.435
He looked down at Olivia with a sly grin.

42
00:03:21.436 --> 00:03:26.440
Suddenly his face went pale.

43
00:03:26.441 --> 00:03:29.695
"Are you okay?" Olivia asked.

44
00:03:29.696 --> 00:03:36.532
Mason was silent. His entire body was now flat against the wall.

45
00:03:36.533 --> 00:03:39.794
"He went up too fast," Olivia thought.

46
00:03:39.795 --> 00:03:44.579
"He didn't realize how high he'd climbed."

47
00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:48.389
Olivia continued up and was soon next to him.

48
00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:50.915
Mason looked terrified.

49
00:03:50.916 --> 00:03:55.557
"H-how come you don't seem s-scared?" he asked his sister.

50
00:03:55.558 --> 00:04:01.266
Olivia grinned. "I went up just a little bit at a time.

51
00:04:01.267 --> 00:04:04.515
That way, I got used to the height slowly.

52
00:04:04.516 --> 00:04:05.754
Now lean back.

53
00:04:05.755 --> 00:04:10.875
You'll be back on the floor soon."

54
00:04:10.876 --> 00:04:16.440
Olivia led her brother down the wall.

55
00:04:16.441 --> 00:04:22.459
When Mason was ready, they climbed up again.

56
00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:25.670
This time he was a bit nervous.

57
00:04:25.671 --> 00:04:31.678
But Olivia wasn't scared at all!

